1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,562
Coding agents can write thousands of lines an hour —

2
00:00:03,562 --> 00:00:06,948
yet developers still spend all day babysitting them, typing:

3
00:00:06,948 --> 00:00:08,217
yes, continue.

4
00:00:08,217 --> 00:00:09,011
Meet smort:

5
00:00:09,011 --> 00:00:13,665
a single-file, zero-dependency operating system for autonomous software engineering,

6
00:00:13,665 --> 00:00:16,416
built to give developers their lives back.

7
00:00:17,766 --> 00:00:21,677
Without structure, AI coding collapses into two failure modes.

8
00:00:21,677 --> 00:00:24,936
Babysit every turn, and you become a human click-bot trapped

9
00:00:24,936 --> 00:00:27,598
in merge conflicts and context amnesia.

10
00:00:27,598 --> 00:00:30,748
Turn off guardrails, and agents ship fake green tests,

11
00:00:30,748 --> 00:00:35,039
silent no-op stubs, circular imports, secret leaks, and hung CI jobs.

12
00:00:35,039 --> 00:00:40,254
smort eliminates both extremes with a Git-native, mechanically verified control plane.

13
00:00:41,454 --> 00:00:44,022
Everything lives inside one portable file:

14
00:00:44,022 --> 00:00:45,362
smort.md.

15
00:00:45,362 --> 00:00:48,656
Run its built-in Python extractor, and in under two hundred

16
00:00:48,656 --> 00:00:52,508
milliseconds it unpacks twenty-six files directly into your repo:

17
00:00:52,508 --> 00:00:57,923
ten governance and spec templates, thirteen executable verification and coordination scripts,

18
00:00:57,923 --> 00:00:59,933
and three starter configs.

19
00:00:59,933 --> 00:01:04,734
Zero third-party packages, zero daemons, zero databases, and zero telemetry.

20
00:01:05,934 --> 00:01:09,765
smort is architected as a four-layer Git-native control plane.

21
00:01:09,765 --> 00:01:12,373
Parallel builders never fight over hot files:

22
00:01:12,373 --> 00:01:16,098
they write to sharded per-task folders, claim branches atomically with

23
00:01:16,098 --> 00:01:21,525
Git compare-and-swap on smort/T-nnn, and feed a single serialized integration lane.

24
00:01:21,525 --> 00:01:24,612
Whenever files disagree, strict fact precedence rules:

25
00:01:24,612 --> 00:01:28,550
live code and observed tests always outrank maps, docs, and handoffs —

26
00:01:28,550 --> 00:01:33,126
and an anti-circularity rule forbids citing any index as verification proof.

27
00:01:34,326 --> 00:01:38,551
The secret to reclaiming your focus is three-tier approval routing.

28
00:01:38,551 --> 00:01:42,557
Low-risk A0 tasks stay inside approved specs and non-sensitive paths,

29
00:01:42,557 --> 00:01:47,606
integrating continuously to main or green-only smort/dev without ever pinging you.

30
00:01:47,606 --> 00:01:48,868
Sensitive A1 work —

31
00:01:48,868 --> 00:01:52,599
auth, billing, migrations, infrastructure, or public contracts —

32
00:01:52,599 --> 00:01:55,947
is enforced mechanically by touch-set-check, built early,

33
00:01:55,947 --> 00:02:00,831
and bundled into a one-screen brief for your scheduled morning or evening slot.

34
00:02:00,831 --> 00:02:05,934
You answer with one batch line, while only true A2 incidents interrupt immediately.

35
00:02:07,184 --> 00:02:11,780
Instead of burning tokens grepping blindly, agents orient through PROJECT-MAP

36
00:02:11,780 --> 00:02:15,182
and smort's native, zero-dependency code-index.

37
00:02:15,182 --> 00:02:18,883
Parsing Python AST alongside TypeScript, JavaScript, Rust,

38
00:02:18,883 --> 00:02:22,703
Go, and package manifests, it computes reverse blast radius,

39
00:02:22,703 --> 00:02:26,463
god-node hubs, runtime import cycles, undeclared map drift,

40
00:02:26,463 --> 00:02:30,522
doc-symbol sync, and security hub bypass scans in milliseconds —

41
00:02:30,522 --> 00:02:34,880
emitting compact agent output with explicit not-shown counters so clipped

42
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:37,088
results never hide reality.

43
00:02:38,288 --> 00:02:41,296
Every change must prove itself mechanically.

44
00:02:41,296 --> 00:02:46,868
Builders commit failing tests first, prove negative controls, and run scripts/verify/gate.

45
00:02:46,868 --> 00:02:50,600
It checks diff size, red-commit ancestry, touch-set boundaries,

46
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:54,333
secret and slop literals, executable doc claims in claims.json,

47
00:02:54,333 --> 00:02:57,731
GitHub Actions timeout guards, and hot-set budgets.

48
00:02:57,731 --> 00:03:01,575
Every PR emits a three-part provenance split separating verified runs

49
00:03:01,575 --> 00:03:03,302
from untested assumptions —

50
00:03:03,302 --> 00:03:09,152
and an independent clean-checkout verifier inspects full files before granting verified status.

51
00:03:10,402 --> 00:03:13,601
Each night, a bounded audit grades the repo across eight

52
00:03:13,601 --> 00:03:17,427
engineering domains using discrete maturity tiers T0 through T3 and

53
00:03:17,427 --> 00:03:19,483
deterministic checklist ratios —

54
00:03:19,483 --> 00:03:22,054
eliminating noisy LLM score jitter.

55
00:03:22,054 --> 00:03:26,109
Meanwhile, lessons-reflect builds bi-temporal, self-healing memory:

56
00:03:26,109 --> 00:03:30,450
deduplicating logs by SHA-256, decaying stale patterns over thirty days,

57
00:03:30,450 --> 00:03:35,190
auto-retiring entries when referenced files change, honoring human corrections with

58
00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:39,874
three-times overriding authority, and supporting full --as-of time travel.

59
00:03:41,074 --> 00:03:43,631
smort even polices its own context tax.

60
00:03:43,631 --> 00:03:47,181
Hot-set budgets keep startup files tight after every compaction,

61
00:03:47,181 --> 00:03:50,573
paired sanity floors block fast-but-wrong performance cheats,

62
00:03:50,573 --> 00:03:55,636
and conflict-matrix predicts both textual merges and semantic risks across shared hubs.

63
00:03:55,636 --> 00:04:00,073
Linked Git worktrees and committer identity guards keep parallel fleets isolated,

64
00:04:00,073 --> 00:04:05,866
while three-outcome triage blocks speculative busywork and gate-brief reports counted autonomous ROI.

65
00:04:07,066 --> 00:04:09,275
Getting started takes seconds.

66
00:04:09,275 --> 00:04:11,649
Drop smort.md into any new or existing

67
00:04:11,649 --> 00:04:13,969
repository and tell your coding agent:

68
00:04:13,969 --> 00:04:16,509
Follow smort.md for this repository —

69
00:04:16,509 --> 00:04:21,645
or run the zero-dependency extractor locally and verify all self-tests immediately.

70
00:04:21,645 --> 00:04:24,185
Approve the spec once, reclaim your focus,

71
00:04:24,185 --> 00:04:26,946
and let verified autonomy ship the work.

72
00:04:26,946 --> 00:04:31,474
Explore the full specification at github.com/smolboon/smort.
